    "overview": "Experience powerful sound and seamless connectivity with the Intex Buds Neo True Wireless Earbuds. Designed for immersive listening, these earbuds feature a 13mm dynamic driver that delivers deep bass and crystal-clear audio. The advanced AI Environmental Noise Cancellation (AI-ENC) ensures clear voice calls even in noisy surroundings. With Bluetooth 5.4 technology, you get faster pairing, stable connectivity, and low latency for gaming and streaming. Enjoy up to 32 hours of total playtime with the charging case, keeping your music going all day long. The auto-pairing feature connects instantly to your device, while easy touch controls and voice assistant support make operation effortless. The Type-C fast charging port ensures quick power-ups whenever you need them. Perfect for music, calls, and everyday use, the Intex Buds Neo delivers powerful performance in a compact wireless design.",
